{"abstract":[{"text":"Inherited from ","type":"text"},{"code":"Equatable.!=(_:_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"op","extendedModule":"Swift","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL","relatedModules":["Swift"]}],"roleHeading":"Operator","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"!=","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"externalID":"s:SQsE2neoiySbx_xtFZ::SYNTHESIZED::s:7IvorMXL18MXLAccidentalValueO","title":"!=(_:_:)"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalValue\/!=(_:_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalValue"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlaccidentalvalue\/!=(_:_:)"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"!=","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"lhs","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rhs","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLAccidentalValue":{"abstract":[{"text":"The accidental-value type represents notated accidentals supported by MusicXML. In the MusicXML 2.0 DTD this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"was a string with values that could be included. The XSD strengthens the data typing to an enumerated list.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The quarter- and three-quarters- accidentals are Tartini-style quarter-tone accidentals. The -down and -up"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"accidentals are quarter-tone accidentals that include arrows pointing down or up. The slash- accidentals are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"used in Turkish classical music. The numbered sharp and flat accidentals are superscripted versions of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accidental signs, used in Turkish folk music. The sori and koron accidentals are microtonal sharp and flat","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accidentals used in Iranian and Persian music. The other accidental covers accidentals other than those listed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"here. It is usually used in combination with the smufl attribute to specify a particular SMuFL accidental. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"smufl attribute may be used with any accidental value to help specify the appearance of symbols that share the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same MusicXML semantics.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLAccidentalValue","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlaccidentalvalue","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLAccidentalValue"}],"title":"MXLAccidentalValue","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalValue","type":"topic"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLAccidentalValue/!=(_:_:)":{"abstract"